{"id":"453434df21a27b52","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions.md","title":"PA Derivability Conditions","display":"thm-pa-derivability-conditions — PA Derivability Conditions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions","aliases":["89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions"],"display":"thm-pa-derivability-conditions — PA Derivability Conditions","depends_on":["[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-thm-sigma-one-completeness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pa-derivability-conditions — PA Derivability Conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b78fd5923bcaa6c\" href=\"?note=3b78fd5923bcaa6c\" title=\"89-thm-sigma-one-completeness\">89-thm-sigma-one-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是标准有限证明检查的固定直接算术化公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span> 是已有 Hilbert–Bernays–Löb 三条件谓词，区分外部定理条件与内部模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 44–49；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n条件一把一份实际证明的码代入表示公式；条件二编码将两份证明以 MP 拼接的原始递归变换；条件三由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 公式及内部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性得到。这里用的是标准证明谓词，而不是仅标准模型中外延相同的任意替代公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-hilbert-bernays","status":"resolved","id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-sigma-one-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"3b78fd5923bcaa6c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-sigma-one-completeness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HB}(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":1365,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab8391d7623da45d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 3 章，印刷页 51–62；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n对 GL 有限证明归纳。命题重言式的翻译在经典 PA 中可证；K 由第二派生条件验证；Löb 模式由 [[89-thm-lob-internal]] 在 $T=\\mathrm{PA}$ 时的对象语言定理验证；MP 保可证性；必然化由第一派生条件验证。PA 的三条件见独立原子 [[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]。此方向不要求 PA 在自身内部证明一致性，也不使用外部反模型构造。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]] → [[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]] → [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]] → [[89-df-provability-predicate]] → [[89-df-sigma-one-formula]] → [[89-thm-sigma-one-completeness]] → [[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]"}],"outgoing":["9aca87310232fb2f","841985de31202f85","86ad48bbd1843ed6","3b78fd5923bcaa6c"]}